  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1706.04 Reporting Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1706.04 Reporting Requirements. Analytical data for wood ash that does not meet the requirements specified in Env-Sw 1703.02 shall be reported to the department in accordance with Env-Sw 1005.09.\n\nSource. #10601, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
